        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Deep Purple\n- Places: Hertford\n- Products: 24 Carat Purple\n- Organizations: Deep Purple's record company\n- Topics: population, compilation albums\n\nFacts:\n- Deep Purple are an English rock band formed in Hertford in 1968.\n- The 2011 census recorded the population of Hertford, which forms a civil parish, at about 26,000.\n- 24 Carat Purple is the first compilation album by Deep Purple to be released worldwide on the band's own record company.\n- 24 Carat Purple is the third album in a long line of Deep Purple compilation albums.",
